  "ingredients": [
    "0.75 cup graham cracker crumbs",
    "3 tablespoons butter, melted",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "1.5 cups milk",
    "1 (1 ounce) package cheesecake flavor sugar-free instant pudding mix",
    "2 pints fresh strawberries, sliced"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8lCdF57_rrj-wmDosOaXQZv_ENY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM_215589-NoBakeSugarFreeStrawberryCheesecake-ddmfs-step1-3x4-6054-66e6ea0f05fd46309a5828730757fec8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215589/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine graham cracker crumbs, melted butter, cinnamon, and nutmeg in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/teAu4thS3o3QED4ekgWLAlHUe20=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM_215589-NoBakeSugarFreeStrawberryCheesecake-ddmfs-step2-3x4-6057-ab64299cb0a9490dbd24fcf7b6caed37.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215589/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the mixture into an 8-inch pie dish; refrigerate while making the filling.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TWRJHknecl13dn2oyTYB0KUjWq8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM_215589-NoBakeSugarFreeStrawberryCheesecake-ddmfs-step3-3x4-6061-87e04d5db3ef470bbc9c9281421a7495.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215589/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat cream cheese in a mixing bowl with an electric mixer on medium speed until softened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c2dZZaE8CahMNmbYvUlp1kFOeqA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM_215589-NoBakeSugarFreeStrawberryCheesecake-ddmfs-step4-3x4-6063-0f7f226a552144caa3f663e8634ee3a4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215589/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce speed to slow; gradually beat in milk (the mixture will be watery).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gUiS8tmKUzSBnxuYDO_G-Dpp8RY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM_215589-NoBakeSugarFreeStrawberryCheesecake-ddmfs-step5-3x4-6064-a73f183b936e49c38a323b5cd25d10aa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215589/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use a rubber spatula to scrape cream cheese from the sides of the bowl, if necessary. Beat in pudding mix until the filling is thick and smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Jk3Bztr399RuX5xrpx4xCuRt98o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM_215589-NoBakeSugarFreeStrawberryCheesecake-ddmfs-step6-3x4-6068-f763df1ab1c24585a3b61763db7ec0ae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215589/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon 1/2 of the cream cheese filling onto the bottom of prepared crust. Spread 1/2 of the strawberries over the filling; repeat with remaining filling and strawberries.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0YT9vmFYTBv8uGHeJHp6Cg1j0ho=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM_215589-NoBakeSugarFreeStrawberryCheesecake-ddmfs-step8-3x4-6073-72cf961f6962401ca135c4fd54a1829e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215589/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chill pie in refrigerator until filling is set, at least 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/D2mqaImMGL48sbMpDcZ0OR2Hk5w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM_215589-NoBakeSugarFreeStrawberryCheesecake-ddmfs-step9-3x4-6084-04da7b2d76c64edb8a3d2a2b96a1c857.jpg"
      ],
